
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#501b17">
<title>嫁金钗 · 人生剧本鉴定所</title>
<style>
:root{
  --red:#702a24;
  --deep:#381713;
  --brown:#78452e;
  --gold:#bd8c50;
  --paper:#f7e9d1;
  --paper2:#ead1aa;
  --ink:#482719;
  --muted:#99765a;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
  margin:0;
  color:var(--ink);
  font-family:"Microsoft YaHei","PingFang SC",serif;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#85402e 0%,transparent 55%),
    linear-gradient(135deg,#321410,#65271e 50%,#2c100e);
  min-height:100vh;
}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #e5bd75;outline-offset:3px}
button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}
.screen{display:none;min-height:100vh}
.screen.active{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
button,.btn{
  border:1px solid #c99c62;
  border-radius:30px;
  color:#fff0d0;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8d4030,#54201b);
  box-shadow:0 4px 12px #3b171633,inset 0 1px #ffffff20;
  padding:12px 22px;
}
button:active{transform:scale(.98)}
/* 开场 */
#intro{
  justify-content:center;
  align-items:center;
  padding:24px 16px;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  text-align:center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 20%,#9a5535 0%,transparent 50%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,#431a15,#702e23 60%,#35130f);
  color:#f7e5c5;
}
#intro:before,#intro:after{
  content:"❀";
  position:absolute;
  font-size:120px;
  color:#e6bd7c20;
  pointer-events:none;
}
#intro:before{top:3%;left:-20px}
#intro:after{bottom:3%;right:-10px}
.intro-inner{width:min(100%,520px);position:relative;z-index:1}
.seal{
  display:inline-block;
  border:2px solid #d8ac71;
  color:#e7bd7e;
  padding:6px 13px;
  letter-spacing:4px;
  font-size:12px;
  transform:rotate(-4deg);
}
.intro-title{
  font-size:clamp(38px,9vw,62px);
  letter-spacing:5px;
  line-height:1.35;
  margin:24px 0 4px;
  text-shadow:0 3px 0 #3d160f,0 0 24px #edc58c35;
}
.intro-sub{font-size:clamp(20px,5vw,28px);color:#e8c28d}
.intro-desc{line-height:2;color:#e8d1b2;font-size:14px;margin:24px auto}
.intro-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:9px;margin:25px 0}
.intro-tags span{
  border:1px solid #c89c6655;border-radius:20px;padding:7px 12px;
  font-size:12px;color:#f0d6ac;background:#ffffff08
}
.intro-btn{font-size:19px;letter-spacing:3px;padding:15px 38px;margin-top:10px}
.intro-footer{font-size:11px;color:#caa88a;margin-top:35px}
.loading{display:none;margin-top:25px}
.loading-track{height:5px;background:#ffffff24;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0}
.loading-bar{height:100%;width:0;background:#e3bc7e;transition:width .25s}
.loading-text{font-size:13px;color:#ecd0a8;line-height:2}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.fade-up{animation:fadeUp .6s ease both}
/* 答题 */
#quiz{padding:14px 12px 30px;align-items:center}
.quiz-wrap{width:min(100%,680px)}
.topbar{
  color:#f0d8b3;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:10px 4px 16px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px
}
.brand-small{font-size:17px;color:#e6c18a}
.progress-track{height:5px;background:#ffffff25;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 14px}
.progress-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b87c42,#efd19a);transition:width .3s}
.paper{
  position:relative;background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 10%,#fff9e8aa,transparent 40%),
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#f7e9d1 0,#f7e9d1 4px,#f4e3c9 5px);
  border:1px solid #d5ad78;border-radius:10px;
  box-shadow:0 10px 35px #16080560,inset 0 0 0 5px #e9d0a9;
  padding:clamp(18px,5vw,34px);
}
.paper:before{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:8px;border:1px solid #cba77880;
  pointer-events:none;border-radius:5px
}
.chapter{color:#8e4a31;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:13px}
.question-title{font-size:clamp(23px,6vw,31px);line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 15px;color:#63291f}
.question-desc{font-size:15px;line-height:2;color:#593b2a;white-space:pre-line;margin:0 0 20px}
.question-ask{font-size:13px;color:#a06c43;margin-bottom:12px}
.options{display:grid;gap:11px}
.option{
  display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;width:100%;
  border:1px solid #cba477;border-radius:8px;padding:13px 13px;
  background:#fff8e9c9;color:#553423;box-shadow:none;
  transition:background .2s,border-color .2s;
}
.option .letter{
  flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#78402c;color:#f8e4c2;
  font-family:serif;font-weight:bold
}
.option .option-text{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;flex:1}
.option.selected{background:#ead0a7;border:2px solid #8d422e;padding:12px}
.option.selected .letter{background:#a72f25}
.quiz-nav{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:20px}
.quiz-nav button{min-width:115px}
.quiz-note{text-align:center;color:#d5b18a;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;margin-top:17px}
#loadingScreen{align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#f3dfbd}
.loading-seal{font-size:46px;margin-bottom:20px}
#loadingScreen h2{letter-spacing:4px;font-size:26px}
.loading-list{display:grid;gap:13px;text-align:left;width:min(100%,330px);margin:30px auto;color:#e5c8a2;font-size:14px}
.loading-list span:before{content:"◇";color:#e5b86c;margin-right:12px}
/* 结果 */
#resultScreen{padding:12px 10px 35px;align-items:center}
.result-wrap{width:min(100%,1000px);background:var(--paper);border:3px solid #c99a61;box-shadow:0 15px 45px #16080577;position:relative}
.result-wrap:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:7px;border:1px solid #c59a68;pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
.result-header{
  text-align:center;padding:22px 15px 16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ead0a7,#f9edda,#e8cba1);
  border-bottom:1px solid #caa174;position:relative
}
.result-brand{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8e5335}
.result-brand strong{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#67271d;display:block;margin:5px 0}
.result-subtitle{font-size:12px;color:#946b48}
.result-body{padding:15px;position:relative;z-index:2}
.result-hero{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(95px,190px) 1fr;gap:17px;align-items:center;
  border-bottom:1px solid #cba77c;padding:12px 0 20px
}
.portrait-placeholder{
  width:100%;aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:50%;
  border:5px solid #d6b27c;background:#e9d3b0;
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px #f9edda;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;
  color:#a17b55;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;padding:12px
}
.result-eyebrow{font-size:12px;color:#95623e}
.result-name{font-size:clamp(22px,5vw,35px);line-height:1.5;color:#8b3026;margin:7px 0;font-weight:bold}
.character-name{font-size:18px;color:#75432d;margin:5px 0 9px}
.result-sentence{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#573522}
.pass-stamp{
  display:inline-block;border:3px double #a83b2c;color:#a83b2c;
  padding:7px 10px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:3px;transform:rotate(7deg);
  margin-top:10px;font-size:12px
}
.result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.18fr;gap:14px;margin-top:16px}
.left-col,.right-col{min-width:0}
.section-card{
  border:1px solid #d3b18a;border-radius:9px;padding:14px;
  background:#fff6e6a0;margin-bottom:13px
}
.section-title{
  font-size:18px;color:#63351f;margin:0 0 13px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #d9bc98;padding-bottom:8px
}
.radar-wrap{width:100%;max-width:340px;margin:auto}
#radar{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.radar-labels{display:none}
.attribute-list{display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:10px}
.attr-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px}
.attr-track{height:6px;border-radius:10px;background:#e4cfaf;overflow:hidden}
.attr-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a53f2f,#c98459);border-radius:10px}
.verdict{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4dfbd,#e9cda0);
  border:1px solid #c99d69;padding:18px;border-radius:9px;
  font-size:14px;line-height:2;white-space:pre-line
}
.verdict p{margin:0 0 9px}
.verdict p:last-child{margin:0}
.verdict .verdict-sign{color:#9d392b;text-align:right;font-weight:bold}
.chat-panel{
  border:1px solid #d0ad84;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f1e3d0,#f8eee0)
}
.chat-head{padding:12px;background:#ead4b5;border-bottom:1px solid #d4b28a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.chat-avatar{
  width:39px;height:39px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #c59a65;
  background:#e3c8a4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:11px;color:#83593a;flex:none
}
.chat-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:bold}
.chat-status{font-size:11px;color:#99785b;margin-top:3px}
.chat-more{margin-left:auto;color:#9e8063}
.chat-messages{padding:13px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px}
.chat-row{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:flex-start;max-width:95%}
.chat-row.user{align-self:flex-end;flex-direction:row-reverse}
.chat-row .mini-avatar{
  flex:none;width:29px;height:29px;border-radius:50%;background:#d7b58c;
  border:1px solid #bd986b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:10px;color:#73442b
}
.bubble{padding:9px 11px;border-radius:4px;background:#fffdf8;border:1px solid #e6d8c5;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.chat-row.user .bubble{background:#c8e7a7;border-color:#b3d58f}
.chat-time{font-size:9px;color:#b29a7f;margin-top:3px}
.chat-row.user .chat-time{text-align:right}
.bottom-cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:14px}
.mini-card{border:1px solid #d2ad80;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;background:#fff5e3;min-width:0}
.mini-card h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 10px;color:#75452b}
.mini-card p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;margin:0;white-space:pre-line;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.mini-card .small-quote{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#7b3025}
.result-actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:18px 10px 12px}
.result-actions button{font-size:13px;padding:12px 17px}
.footer-note{text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#a28161;padding:0 10px 16px}
.toast{
  position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:25px;transform:translateX(-50%);
  background:#3c1b15;color:#f8e4c3;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:30px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 20px #0004;font-size:13px;z-index:99;
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .25s
}
.toast.show{opacity:1}
@media(min-width:700px){
  #quiz{padding-top:25px}
  .question-desc{font-size:16px}
  .option .option-text{font-size:15px}
  .result-body{padding:24px}
  .result-grid{gap:20px}
  .section-card{padding:20px}
  .chat-messages{padding:18px;gap:16px}
  .bubble{font-size:14px;padding:11px 13px}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  #resultScreen{padding:6px 4px 20px}
  .result-header{padding:18px 10px 12px}
  .result-brand strong{font-size:23px}
  .result-body{padding:10px}
  .result-hero{grid-template-columns:100px 1fr;gap:12px}
  .portrait-placeholder{font-size:10px;border-width:3px}
  .result-name{font-size:22px}
  .character-name{font-size:16px}
  .result-sentence{font-size:12px}
  .result-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
  .left-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
  .bottom-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .mini-card{padding:14px}
  .mini-card h3{font-size:16px}
  .mini-card p{font-size:13px}
  .result-actions{gap:7px;padding:15px 3px}
  .result-actions button{padding:11px 12px;font-size:12px}
  .section-card{padding:12px}
  .chat-messages{padding:12px 8px}
  .bubble{font-size:12px}
  .quiz-nav button{min-width:0;flex:1;padding:12px 10px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}
}
@media print{
  body{background:white}
  #intro,#quiz,#loadingScreen,.result-actions,.toast{display:none!important}
  #resultScreen{display:block!important;padding:0}
  .result-wrap{width:100%;box-shadow:none;border:1px solid #bd966a}
  .result-wrap:before{display:none}
  .result-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr}
  .bottom-cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .result-body{padding:10px}
  .chat-panel,.section-card,.mini-card,.verdict{break-inside:avoid}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ==================== 开场 ==================== -->
<section id="intro" class="screen active">
  <div class="intro-inner">
    <div class="seal">人生剧本鉴定所 · 特别企划</div>
    <div class="intro-title">嫁金钗</div>
    <div class="intro-sub">人生剧本鉴定所</div>
    <p class="intro-desc">
      如果你也身处一场命运棋局，<br>
      你会是执棋的人，破局的人，还是被迫入局的人？<br>
      十五道情境题，鉴定你的专属命格。
    </p>
    <div class="intro-tags">
      <span>性格洞察</span><span>宅斗生存</span>
      <span>人情博弈</span><span>爱情选择</span>
    </div>
    <button class="intro-btn" id="startBtn" onclick="startLoading()">✦ 开始鉴定 ✦</button>
    <div class="loading" id="introLoading">
      <div class="loading-text" id="introLoadingText">正在核验入局身份……</div>
      <div class="loading-track"><div class="loading-bar" id="introBar"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-footer">原创趣味测试 · 非剧集官方互动产品</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ==================== 答题 ==================== -->
<section id="quiz" class="screen">
  <div class="quiz-wrap">
    <div class="topbar">
      <span class="brand-small">嫁金钗 · 人生剧本鉴定所</span>
      <span id="questionCount">第 1 题 / 共 15 题</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div></div>
    <div class="paper fade-up" id="questionPaper">
      <div class="chapter" id="chapterName">第一幕：命运初局</div>
      <h1 class="question-title" id="questionTitle"></h1>
      <p class="question-desc" id="questionDesc"></p>
      <div class="question-ask">你会怎么做？</div>
      <div class="options" id="options"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="quiz-nav">
      <button id="prevBtn" onclick="previousQuestion()">← 上一题</button>
      <button id="nextBtn" onclick="nextQuestion()" disabled>下一题 →</button>
    </div>
    <div class="quiz-note">答案没有标准对错 · 请按第一反应选择<br>所有选择都会参与命格匹配</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ==================== 分析动画 ==================== -->
<section id="loadingScreen" class="screen">
  <div>
    <div class="loading-seal">✧</div>
    <h2>正在推演你的命格</h2>
    <p style="color:#d9b58b;line-height:2">命运落子，皆有缘由。<br>正在整理你的选择与处事倾向……</p>
    <div class="loading-track" style="width:min(80vw,340px);margin:25px auto">
      <div class="loading-bar" id="resultBar"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="loading-list">
      <span>分析谋略与行动倾向</span>
      <span>计算清醒与共情属性</span>
      <span>评估个人边界感</span>
      <span>匹配最接近的命格原型</span>
    </div>
    <div id="loadingPercent" style="color:#e4bf87">0%</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ==================== 结果页 ==================== -->
<section id="resultScreen" class="screen">
  <div class="result-wrap" id="resultCard">
    <header class="result-header">
      <div class="result-brand">
        <strong>嫁金钗</strong>
        人生剧本鉴定所
      </div>
      <div class="result-subtitle">你的性格 × 宅斗力 × 生存力 × 爱情观</div>
    </header>

    <div class="result-body">
      <div class="result-hero">
        <!-- 真人头像预留位置：这里不放图片代码，可自行添加 -->
        <div class="portrait-placeholder">
          真人头像<br>预留位置<br><span style="font-size:10px">自行添加图片</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="result-eyebrow">你的命格是</div>
          <div class="result-name" id="resultTitle">全府最不好惹的打工人</div>
          <div class="character-name" id="resultCharacter">对应人物：魏娆（阿丑）</div>
          <div class="result-sentence" id="resultSlogan"></div>
          <div class="pass-stamp">鉴定通过</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="result-grid">
        <div class="left-col">
          <div class="section-card">
            <h2 class="section-title">你的五维属性</h2>
            <div class="radar-wrap">
              <canvas id="radar" width="500" height="450" aria-label="五维属性雷达图"></canvas>
            </div>
            <div class="attribute-list" id="attributeList"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="verdict">
            <h2 class="section-title">命格批注</h2>
            <div id="verdictText"></div>
            <p class="verdict-sign">—— 人生剧本鉴定所</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="right-col">
          <div class="chat-panel">
            <div class="chat-head">
              <div class="chat-avatar" id="chatHeadAvatar">人物</div>
              <div>
                <div class="chat-name" id="chatHeadName">命格本人</div>
                <div class="chat-status">在线 · 正在观察你的命运</div>
              </div>
              <div class="chat-more">•••</div>
            </div>
            <div class="chat-messages" id="chatMessages"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bottom-cards">
        <div class="mini-card">
          <h3>✿ 专属名场面</h3>
          <p id="sceneText"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="mini-card">
          <h3>⚠ 危险提示</h3>
          <p id="dangerText"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="mini-card">
          <h3>✦ 人格金句</h3>
          <p class="small-quote" id="quoteText"></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="result-actions">
        <button onclick="restartTest()">↻ 重新测一次</button>
        <button onclick="copyShare()">☷ 复制分享文案</button>
        <button onclick="saveResult()">↓ 保存结果卡</button>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-note">嫁金钗 · 人生剧本鉴定所<br>原创趣味测试 · 非剧集官方互动产品</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

<script>
"use strict";

/*
 * 五维计分：
 * [谋略值, 行动力, 清醒值, 共情值, 边界感]
 * 每道题每个选项都拥有独立计分向量。
 * 结果通过用户五维画像与八个人物原型的距离匹配。
 */

const DIMENSIONS = ["谋略值","行动力","清醒值","共情值","边界感"];
const LETTERS = ["A","B","C","D"];

const QUESTIONS = [
{
 chapter:"第一幕：命运初局",
 title:"新婚当夜，世子醒了",
 desc:"你原本以为这场冲喜婚事只是走个过场，没想到新婚当夜，昏迷已久的世子竟然醒了。他看着你，接连问了几个关于“新娘过去经历”的问题，明显对你的身份有所怀疑。\n\n你会怎么做？",
 options:[
  {text:"先稳住场面。顺着他的问题回答，同时观察他究竟知道多少。",s:[5,2,4,1,3]},
  {text:"把话挑明。既然两个人都被这场婚事推到了局里，不如谈谈彼此的真实处境。",s:[3,4,4,4,4]},
  {text:"不急着解释。先分清哪些是他掌握的事实，哪些只是试探，再决定要解释到哪一步。",s:[5,1,5,0,3]},
  {text:"先处理眼前的问题。找出最容易露出破绽的地方，逐个解决。",s:[2,5,3,0,3]}
 ]
},
{
 chapter:"第一幕：命运初局",
 title:"主母开始观察你了",
 desc:"成婚几日后，府中主母没有直接为难你，却开始留意你的言行、待人方式和处事分寸。她既没有明确表示接纳，也没有告诉你究竟在考察什么。\n\n你觉得最稳妥的做法是什么？",
 options:[
  {text:"主动了解府中规矩。先弄明白哪些事能做、哪些话不能随便说。",s:[3,3,4,2,4]},
  {text:"不刻意讨好。礼数做到位，但不把每个人的评价都当成人生判决书。",s:[1,3,4,1,5]},
  {text:"观察她真正看重什么。从她对不同人的态度里判断她的行事标准。",s:[5,2,5,1,3]},
  {text:"把自己分内的事做好。不急着争取认可，先让别人看到自己办事可靠。",s:[2,5,3,2,3]}
 ]
},
{
 chapter:"第一幕：命运初局",
 title:"一场家宴，座次有讲究",
 desc:"英国公府设宴，席位安排看似寻常，实际上每个位置都代表着身份、亲疏和家族关系。有人特意把你安排在一个容易引起议论的位置，似乎在等你反应。\n\n你会怎么做？",
 options:[
  {text:"先看清楚全场的安排。弄明白这究竟是疏忽、试探，还是有人刻意为之。",s:[5,1,5,1,3]},
  {text:"当场提出调整。这个位置代表什么，我心里清楚；既然不合适，就不能任由别人替我决定。",s:[2,5,4,0,5]},
  {text:"暂时不计较座次。先把宴席应付好，记下是谁安排的，以后再处理。",s:[5,2,4,0,4]},
  {text:"不让身边人难堪。先顾全当下场面，宴后再找合适的人说明情况。",s:[2,2,3,5,3]}
 ]
},
{
 chapter:"第一幕：命运初局",
 title:"府中传出一桩不利于你的流言",
 desc:"有人私下议论你的来历，说法越传越离谱。你不知道最初是谁说的，也不清楚对方究竟想达到什么目的。\n\n你会怎么处理？",
 options:[
  {text:"追查流言源头。先弄清楚消息从哪里来、经过了哪些人的嘴。",s:[5,3,5,0,3]},
  {text:"找关键人物谈清楚。不让谣言一直发酵，能当面解决就不拖。",s:[2,5,4,1,5]},
  {text:"不急着自证。先观察流言会不会影响真正重要的人和事，再决定怎么回应。",s:[5,1,5,0,4]},
  {text:"先护住可能被牵连的人。提醒可信的人谨慎言行，避免无辜的人受伤，再慢慢查清是谁在背后推动。",s:[2,2,3,5,4]}
 ]
},
{
 chapter:"第二幕：人情与暗流",
 title:"有人想借你的名义办一件事",
 desc:"一位府中亲眷想借你的名义向长辈求情。她说事情不大，只需要你出面说几句话，却始终不肯把全部缘由告诉你。\n\n你会怎么做？",
 options:[
  {text:"先问清楚事情经过。连事情是什么都不知道，就让我签字画押？我又不是自动盖章的官印。",s:[4,3,5,1,4]},
  {text:"直接拒绝。不愿意说清楚，就不要指望我替你担责任。",s:[1,4,4,0,5]},
  {text:"先判断事情的后果。如果牵涉重大利益，就不能只听一面之词。",s:[5,2,5,0,4]},
  {text:"看看她是否真的遇到了难处。可以帮忙，但会先说清自己能帮到什么程度，不替她把责任全扛下来。",s:[2,2,3,5,4]}
 ]
},
{
 chapter:"第二幕：人情与暗流",
 title:"一份迟来的礼物",
 desc:"你在意的人此前一直没有解释某件让你不舒服的事，今天却突然送来一份贵重礼物。对方没有提起之前的问题，只说了一句：“我知道你喜欢这个。”\n\n你会怎么做？",
 options:[
  {text:"先收下心意，再问清楚之前的事。礼物可以收，问题不能自动清零。",s:[2,3,4,4,4]},
  {text:"直接问个明白。送礼物不是免答题卡，之前的事还是得说清楚。",s:[1,5,4,2,5]},
  {text:"暂时不下结论。看看他接下来是否愿意解释，以及行为有没有改变。",s:[4,2,5,2,4]},
  {text:"先了解对方的难处。也许事情另有原因，但理解不代表以后都不必交代。",s:[2,2,4,5,3]}
 ]
},
{
 chapter:"第二幕：人情与暗流",
 title:"你发现一件可能改变家族关系的秘密",
